::ingredients

(egg) 2
(milk) 1/2 cup, or 1/4 cup for more solid consistency
(bread) 5 slices
(maple syrup, optional) as needed
(butter) as needed for frying

::equipment

(frying pan)
(bowl)
(beater)
(butter knife)

::instructions

(butter) <grease, frying pan> <heat, low-medium>
(egg) <crack, bowl>
    + (milk) <beat, break yolks and stir until smooth yellow liquid>
Repeat [
    (bread) <dip, one side into egg mixture, cover entire surface>
        <lift, immediately> <scrape, excess liquid with butter knife>
        <dip, other side> <lift, immediately> <scrape, excess liquid>
        <fry, hot pan, both sides until golden brown>
        <transfer, plate>
    Optional [
        (butter) <add, between slices if needed>
    ]
]
for each bread slice
Optional [
    (maple syrup) <pour, drench toast stack>
]

::story

This recipe results in five slices of easy to make french toast.

